section":"chapter-049","block":"b-66f2d52fde94a20ba685","layer":"original","quote":"过杀礼，然后杀皓。","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":7,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":84,"end":93,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o002a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-501565c8252ddb7ebc4f","layer":"original","quote":"亮早孤〖2〗。从父玄，为袁术所署豫章太守〖3〗，玄将亮及亮弟均之官〖4〗。会汉朝更选朱皓代玄；玄素与荆州牧刘表有旧，往依之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-p001a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-0ba957ed490b6345b7bd","layer":"pei","quote":"初，豫章太守周术病卒，刘表上诸葛玄为豫章太守，治南昌。汉朝闻周术死，遣朱皓代玄。皓从扬州刺史刘繇求兵，击玄；玄退屯西城：皓入南昌。","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43698058f80b13e4af1b","start":12,"end":77,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o002","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-501565c8252ddb7ebc4f","layer":"original","quote":"亮早孤〖2〗。从父玄，为袁术所署豫章太守〖3〗，玄将亮及亮弟均之官〖4〗。会汉朝更选朱皓代玄；玄素与荆州牧刘表有旧，往依之。﹝一﹞","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p001","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-0ba957ed490b6345b7bd","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《献帝春秋》曰：“初，豫章太守周术病卒，刘表上诸葛玄为豫章太守，治南昌。汉朝闻周术死，遣朱皓代玄。皓从扬州刺史刘繇求兵，击玄；玄退屯西城：皓入南昌。建安二年正月，西城民反，杀玄，送首诣繇。”此书所云，与本传不同。","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":23,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-43698058f80b13e4af1b","start":0,"end":109,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
